      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.661025000000009,
        492.85464999999999,
        312.025375,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "Nami,Ahmad al Haznawi, and Ziad Jarrah checked in at the United Airlines"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.661025000000009,
        481.60424999999998,
        311.97514999999987,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "ticket counter for Flight 93, going to Los Angeles.Two checked bags; two did"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.661025000000009,
        470.35384999999997,
        311.99257500000004,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "not.Haznawi was selected by CAPPS.His checked bag was screened for explo-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.659999999999997,
        459.10344999999995,
        144.85686500000003,
        9.4736250000000268
      ],
      "text" : "sives and then loaded on the plane.18"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.660000000000004,
        447.85505000000001,
        299.94677500000017,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "The four men passed through the security checkpoint, owned by United"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660325,
        436.60464999999999,
        311.93517500000013,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "Airlines and operated under contract by Argenbright Security. Like the check-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660325,
        425.35424999999998,
        312.02025000000009,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "points in Boston, it lacked closed-circuit television surveillance so there is no"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660325,
        414.10384999999997,
        312.02230000000003,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "documentary evidence to indicate when the hijackers passed through the"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660325,
        402.85344999999995,
        312.01820000000004,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "checkpoint,what alarms may have been triggered,or what security procedures"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.661349999999999,
        391.60304999999994,
        311.98335000000009,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "were administered.The FAA interviewed the screeners later;none recalled any-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.664425000000001,
        380.35264999999993,
        119.06994000000003,
        9.4744250000000534
      ],
      "text" : "thing unusual or suspicious.19"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.660000000000004,
        369.10505000000001,
        300.00520000000023,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "The four men boarded the plane between 7:39 and 7:48. All four had seats"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660325,
        357.85464999999999,
        312.02332499999983,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "in the first-class cabin; their plane had no business-class section. Jarrah was in"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660325,
        346.60424999999998,
        312.00487500000025,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "seat 1B, closest to the cockpit; Nami was in 3C, Ghamdi in 3D, and Haznawi"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.658275000000003,
        335.35384999999997,
        32.339222499999977,
        9.4732250000000136
      ],
      "text" : "in 6B.20"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.660000000000004,
        324.10505000000001,
        300.00839999999999,
        9.4720249999999737
      ],
      "text" : "The 19 men were aboard four transcontinental flights.21 They were plan-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660449999999997,
        312.85464999999999,
        312.02742499999999,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "ning to hijack these planes and turn them into large guided missiles, loaded"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660449999999997,
        301.60424999999998,
        311.99847499999998,
        9.2873000000000161
      ],
      "text" : "with up to 11,400 gallons of jet fuel. By 8:00 A.M. on the morning of Tuesday,"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660200000000003,
        290.35464999999999,
        312.01819999999998,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "September 11,2001,they had defeated all the security layers that America’s civil"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660200000000003,
        279.10424999999998,
        261.60050000000001,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "aviation security system then had in place to prevent a hijacking."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.659175000000005,
        256.665975,
        140.14927499999999,
        9.2147499999999809
      ],
      "text" : "The Hijacking of American 11"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.659175000000005,
        245.35407499999999,
        312.05407500000013,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "American Airlines Flight 11 provided nonstop service from Boston to Los"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.661225000000002,
        234.10367499999998,
        312.02025000000009,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "Angeles. On September 11, Captain John Ogonowski and First Officer"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660200000000003,
        222.85327499999997,
        312.07560000000001,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "Thomas McGuinness piloted the Boeing 767.It carried its full capacity of nine"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660200000000003,
        211.60287499999995,
        312.07662500000004,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "flight attendants. Eighty-one passengers boarded the flight with them (includ-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660200000000003,
        200.35247499999994,
        96.647265000000033,
        9.4746000000000663
      ],
      "text" : "ing the five terrorists).22"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.660000000000004,
        189.10505000000001,
        299.98162499999984,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "The plane took off at 7:59. Just before 8:14, it had climbed to 26,000 feet,"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.661349999999999,
        177.85464999999999,
        311.99872499999981,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "not quite its initial assigned cruising altitude of 29,000 feet.All communications"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.662374999999997,
        166.60424999999998,
        311.98744999999985,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "and flight profile data were normal.About this time the “Fasten Seatbelt” sign"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.662374999999997,
        155.35384999999997,
        311.94644999999997,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "would usually have been turned off and the flight attendants would have begun"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.663399999999996,
        144.10344999999995,
        115.94672500000004,
        9.4736250000000553
      ],
      "text" : "preparing for cabin service.23"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        51.660000000000004,
        132.85505000000001,
        299.9939250000001,
        9.2864999999999895
      ],
      "text" : "At that same time, American 11 had its last routine communication with"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660325,
        121.60465000000001,
        311.94337500000017,
        9.2865000000000038
      ],
      "text" : "the ground when it acknowledged navigational instructions from the FAA’s"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660325,
        110.35425000000001,
        312.01512500000007,
        9.2865000000000038
      ],
      "text" : "air traffic control (ATC) center in Boston.Sixteen seconds after that transmis-"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660325,
        99.103850000000008,
        312.01000000000028,
        9.2865000000000038
      ],
      "text" : "sion,ATC instructed the aircraft’s pilots to climb to 35,000 feet.That message"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660325,
        87.853450000000009,
        311.98027500000006,
        9.2865000000000038
      ],
      "text" : "and all subsequent attempts to contact the flight were not acknowledged."
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.661349999999999,
        76.60305000000001,
        311.99360000000001,
        9.2865000000000038
      ],
      "text" : "From this and other evidence, we believe the hijacking began at 8:14 or"
    },
    {
      "fontSize" : 10.25,
      "monospaced" : false,
      "rect" : [
        39.660325,
        65.352650000000011,
        79.071215000000024,
        9.4744249999999965
      ],
      "text" : "shortly thereafter.24"
    }
